  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Chef's most anticipated game, Empty Knight: Wool Aria, released on September 444-th at midnight.\n\nSince the instant it released, Chef has been playing it non-stop, and completely lost track of time.\n\nIf the current date is the XXX-th of September, and the current time is HHH hours past midnight, how many hours has Chef been playing?\n\nNote that each day has 242424 hours.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first and only line of input consists of two space-separated integers XXX and HHH — the current date, and the current time (in hours past midnight).\n\n\nOutput Format\nOutput a single integer: the number of hours Chef has been playing for.",
    "constraints": [
      "4≤X≤304 \\le X \\le 304≤X≤30",
      "0≤H&lt;240 \\le H \\lt 240≤H&lt;24"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
    "sampleTestCases": [
      {
        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "5 10",
        "output": "34",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nIt is 101010 hours past midnight on September 555-th.\nChef has played for all of 444-th September, and 101010 hours on the 555-th, for 24+10=3424+10 = 3424+10=34 hours in total."
      },
      {
        "id": "sample_2",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "4 18",
        "output": "18",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nIt is 181818 hours past midnight on September 444-th.\nChef has played only 181818 hours on the 444-th."
      },
      {
        "id": "sample_3",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "10 2",
        "output": "146",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nIt is 222 hours past midnight on September 101010-th.\nChef has played for all of 444-th through 999-th of September, and 222 hours on the 101010-th.\nThat's six full days and two hours, for a total of 24+24+24+24+24+24+2=14624+24+24+24+24+24+2 = 14624+24+24+24+24+24+2=146 hours."
      }
    ]
  },
